{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55354","headline":"简寂观 · 孙鲂","name":"简寂观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[廊]（郎）殿与云连，紫霄苍翠边。\n自然应有药，谁敢道无仙？\n藓色吞崖径，松声让瀑泉。\n未能长息去，岂便是前缘！（见《吉石盦丛书》本《庐山记》卷四。\n「廊」字从《殷礼在斯堂丛书》本改。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙鲂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}